          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767730031401_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Candidate Recommendation Advisor. Analyze the provided candidate list {{$context.$nodes.TALENTADVISORWFAGENT.$output.output}}, then return a concise, urgency-ranked list of those needing attention. You MUST get exactly **5 candidates** total.\n\nAfter Analyze, determine the top 5 candidates at risk by analyzing the following data:\n - Select exactly 5 candidates.\n - Ensure candidates are selected from **at least 2 different requisitions** (Diversity Rule).\n - Sort primarily by **Strong Match** score and **Highly Active** status.\n\n#FORMATTING RULES\n- Accuracy: Do not assume or fabricate data.\n- Conciseness: Strictly limit display to the requested fields.\n\nGenerate a **multiRecordWidget** following the next details:\n\nFor widget title, generate a brief summary (e.g., \"Top 5 candidate for your review\").\n\nFORMAT INSTRUCTIONS\n\n# TITLE\nFormat: <Name> | <Requisition>\n\n# SUBTITLE\nFormat: <Activity Status> | <Match Strength>\n\n# SUMMARY\nWrite exactly one friendly, plain-language sentence explaining why they are a good fit.\n\n# BADGE TEXT (Recommendation)\nAssign a single severity badge based on your ranking analysis:\n1) Top 3 ranked candidates (Highest Match + Activity): Strong \n2) Remaining 2 candidates: Medium\n\n# TIMESTAMP\nDo NOT display timestamp value.\n\nFor each item in the list, generate an action following the next logic: \n\n1) For the **First 3** Candidates (Top Rank):\n- followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(AddProspect, AddProspect-<PersonId,RequisitionId>)\n- actionText must be \"Add as Prospect\".\n\n2) For the **Last 2** Candidates:\n- followUpCommand:  ora.Invoke(InviteToEvent, InviteToEvent-<PersonId>)\n- actionText must be \"Invite To Event\"."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Action",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "var inputObj = $context.$triggers.REST.$input || {};\nvar rawInput = inputObj.OraAction || inputObj.oraAction;\nvar payloadData = {};\nvar detectedAction = '';\n\nif (typeof rawInput === 'string') {\n    var cleanInput = rawInput.trim();\n    if (cleanInput.indexOf('{') === 0) {\n        try {\n            payloadData = JSON.parse(cleanInput);\n            if (payloadData.action !== undefined && payloadData.action !== null) {\n                detectedAction = payloadData.action;\n            }\n        } catch (e) {\n            detectedAction = '';\n        }\n    } else {\n        detectedAction = cleanInput;\n    }\n} else if (rawInput && typeof rawInput === 'object') {\n    payloadData = rawInput;\n    if (rawInput.action !== undefined && rawInput.action !== null) {\n        detectedAction = rawInput.action;\n    } else if (rawInput.followUpCommand !== undefined && rawInput.followUpCommand !== null) {\n        detectedAction = rawInput.followUpCommand;\n    }\n}\n\nvar cleanAction = '';\nif (detectedAction !== undefined && detectedAction !== null && detectedAction !== '') {\n    cleanAction = String(detectedAction).toUpperCase().replace(/_/g, '').replace(/\\s/g, '');\n}\n\nvar actionType = 'STANDARD';\nif (cleanAction.indexOf('BULK') >= 0) {\n    actionType = 'BULK';\n}\n\nreturn actionType;"
          },
